@@ -0,0 +1,362 @@
+/*
+ * SBE 2T3E3 synchronous serial card driver for Linux
+ *
+ * Copyright (C) 2009-2010 Krzysztof Halasa <khc@pm.waw.pl>
+ *
+ * This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modif=
y it
